            </svg>
            Critical Concern
          </h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
            As <strong>MediaNama</strong> reported, "The replacement of volunteer editorial oversight with algorithmic generation raises issues around trust, bias, accountability and liability." Without transparent processes, users cannot assess the reliability of information or identify systematic biases in content generation.
          </p>
        </div>

